{"ID":"20240206102644-2mdzr2o","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206102644-2mdzr2o","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102644-2mdzr2o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102655-in28wcj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240613085055-x1vcj5p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206102655-in28wcj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"284青葙子","type":"doc","updated":"20240823104954"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206102655-in28wcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102655-in28wcj","updated":"20240206102658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于四川、江苏、湖南、湖北、广东、广西等地。\n【性状】\t本品呈扁圆形，少数呈圆形。表面黑色或红黑色。光亮，中间微隆起，侧边微凹处有种脐，种皮簿而脆。气微、味淡。\n【性味】\t苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t清肝泻火，明目退韾。用于肝热口赤，目生韾膜，视物昏花，肝火眩晕。"}]},{"ID":"20240206102651-im5ku8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206102651-im5ku8v","updated":"20240206102651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206102650-i36440x.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240629084701-7rht57j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240629084701-7rht57j","updated":"20240629084701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 652px;","style":"width: 642px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青葙子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青葙子2-20240629084701-xmvpd30.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 642px;\" parent-style=\"width: 652px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823104334-21gi37l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823104334-21gi37l","updated":"20240823104347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 354px;","style":"width: 344px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青葙子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青葙子 1-20240823104334-bv7pqia.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 344px;\" parent-style=\"width: 354px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 850px;","style":"width: 840px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194428-f0bc9li.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 840px;\" parent-style=\"width: 850px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240823104502-00bu8ql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240823104502-00bu8ql","updated":"20240823104759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 777px;","style":"width: 767px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青葙子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青葙子 2-20240823104502-i53or2m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 767px;\" parent-style=\"width: 777px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"